Jw5yX0dZijLFSFYDqank/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">this template</a>:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Column 1</strong>: Vexing Answer Choice</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Column 2</strong>: Answer Choice Translation</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Column 3</strong>: Corresponding Stimulus</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Collect all the difficult answer choices to translate, focusing especially on Method/Flaw/Argument Part answer choices.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>This could include harvesting answer choices from your sections immediately after you're done or going back over old sections to harvest answer choices.</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Write the difficult answers in the Vexing Answer Choice column of the spreadsheet, one answer choice per row.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Translate the answers in the Answer Choice Translation column of the spreadsheet.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>In the Corresponding Stimulus column of the spreadsheet, write an example stimulus which would make the answer choice in that row correct.</p>\n</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"pt-2\"><a href=\"/workouts-and-routines/workouts/method-flaw-argument-part-answer-choice-translation-spreadsheet\"><button class=\"\n    inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-full\n    font-extrabold uppercase lh-outline\n    [transition:background-color_0.15s_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1),border-color_0.15s_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1),box-shadow_0.15s_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1),translate_0.15s_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1)]\n    disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50\n   \n          border-black text-black\n          hover:not-disabled:-translate-x-[3px]\n          hover:not-disabled:-translate-y-[3px]\n          hover:not-disabled:shadow-[3px_3px_0_0_#171712]\n          active:not-disabled:-translate-x-[1px]\n          active:not-disabled:-translate-y-[1px]\n          active:not-disabled:shadow-[1px_1px_0_0_#171712]\n         h-[38px] gap-2 text-caption-medium border-[2px] pl-4 pr-3\">See full workout details<s